  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/types/FileSystemCapabilities.ts#FileSystemFile]
  note: The shape matches. `processEntry` only ever emits `type: 'markdown'` because `isSupportedFile` accepts .md/.markdown only.
```

