```mdl
verdict WorkspaceSettings: The settings form edits icon and hue and can remove the folder; it has no rename and takes no workspace prop.
  status: diverged
  evidence:
    [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/containers/WorkspaceSettingsContainer.tsx#WorkspaceSettingsContainer,
