  note: |
    `WorkspaceSettingsSchema` has only `icon` and `hue`, which are written to the atom and to `.composer/meta.json`. There is no
    name input and no `rename` action. The workspace comes from the layout via `useActiveFileSystemWorkspace`, not from a
