    the default space.
```

```mdl
verdict openDirectory: The op picks, scans, registers or replaces by path, and returns the subject, but does not navigate itself.
  status: partial
  evidence:
    [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/operations/open-directory.ts,
     github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/types/FileSystemOperation.ts#OpenDirectory,
     github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/util.ts#loadWorkspace]
  note: |
    The key, the Void input and the output schema match. Navigation is done by the app-graph action that wraps the op
    (`LayoutOperation.SwitchWorkspace`), so invoking the op directly (e.g. over MCP) does not navigate. Beyond the desc, the op
    also starts watchers, creates the mirror ECHO space and Text objects, writes `.composer/*` and xattrs to disk, and persists
    the list to localforage. No test covers it.
```

