```mdl
verdict F-6.3: There is no rename.
  status: missing
  note: |
    I searched `WorkspaceSettingsContainer.tsx` (the schema has only icon and hue), `util.ts` (`ComposerConfig` has no name field, and
    `loadWorkspace` sets `name` from the path basename on every load), and the operations (none renames). A name edited in the atom
